acy records (2002–2011) identified IAV with and without epilepsy\"}]}\n ],\n \"methods_quotes\": [\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Chi-square statistics were used to compare IAV with epilepsy to IAV without epilepsy on baseline demographic characteristics, comorbid conditions, and mortality.\"},\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The unadjusted Kaplan-Meier estimator and proportional hazards regression models adjusted for demographic characteristics and comorbid conditions were used to calculate hazard ratios.\"},\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"First, analyses determined that there was no evidence of non-proportional hazards.\"},\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Statistically significant differences between groups were identified using a two-tailed significance level (p<0.01).\"}\n ],\n \"confidence\": \"high\",\n \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}